    "frames": [
      {
        "sequence": 0,
        "at_ms": 390,
        "data": "\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[33mtip\u001b[39m: \u001b[36mgt sync\u001b[39m is a core command that keeps your branches in sync with the latest changes to the remote repository. It:\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m▸ pulls the latest changes to the trunk branch\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m▸ prompts to delete any branches whose PRs have been merged or closed\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m▸ syncs any remote changes to branches with open PRs\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m▸ restacks all branches to incorporate the latest changes from trunk\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2mYou can use \u001b[36mgt get\u001b[39m to sync only the stack of the checked out branch. [\u001b[2msync.explanation\u001b[22m\u001b[2m \u001b[2m●○○\u001b[22m\u001b[2m]\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 1,
        "at_ms": 390,
        "data": "\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[33mtip\u001b[39m: Feeling like an expert? Disable tips in \u001b[36mgt config\u001b[39m [\u001b[2mtip.expert-message\u001b[22m\u001b[2m \u001b[2m●\u001b[22m\u001b[2m]\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 2,
        "at_ms": 730,
        "data": "\u001b[91mERROR: Your Graphite auth token is invalid/expired.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[91m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[91mPlease obtain a new auth token by visiting https://app.graphite.com/activate \u001b[39m\r\n"
      }
    ],
